{"kind":"article","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}],"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Ada Script Diagnostics and Performance","role":"article"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptDiagnosticsAndPerformance","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Understand annotation, setup, and runtime failures and keep ECS work on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"native chunk path."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Compilation-diagnostics","text":"Compilation diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin"},{"text":" compiles the source and reads declaration metadata","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"without executing a ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"main()"},{"text":" manifest. Initialization throws","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/compilation(_:)"},{"text":" for syntax or semantic errors and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptError\/invalidManifest(_:)"},{"text":" for invalid AdaEngine annotations.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Examples include ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@system"},{"text":" on a non-class declaration, duplicate system","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"identifiers, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"@query"},{"text":" outside a system class, a query with no fetched","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"components, and a system class that cannot be initialized.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Setup-diagnostics","text":"Setup diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Native component identifiers are resolved during plugin setup so earlier","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"plugins can register game components. Unknown or ambiguous component names skip","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the affected system and append a diagnostic.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Runtime-diagnostics","text":"Runtime diagnostics"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Runtime diagnostics include unknown component aliases, unknown fields,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unsupported values, invalid numeric conversions, and query capabilities used","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"outside their callback lifetime.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Inspect ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/diagnostics"},{"text":" after setup and during development.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"System ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update(context)"},{"text":" callbacks are command-style; their return values are","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"ignored. Tests should assert observable ECS state and diagnostics.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"Performance-model","text":"Performance model"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script query execution traverses native archetypes and chunks. Component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"columns are bound once per chunk, and field access advances a typed pointer by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"row stride. A successful write mutates the component in place and updates its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change tick.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The hot path avoids arrays of matched entity identifiers, one Swift bridge","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object per entity, repeated entity-location lookups, existential component","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"copies, and whole-component reinsertion.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The current embedded C runtime is globally shared and non-reentrant, so runtime entry remains","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"serialized. Scalability comes from native filtering, column iteration, cached","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"metadata, and narrow bridge calls rather than multiple concurrent VMs.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Benchmark scripting changes with multiple archetypes and chunks and compare","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"them with a typed Swift query. Validate semantics before drawing performance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"conclusions.","type":"text"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptdiagnosticsandperformance"]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptTesting"],"title":"ECS Integration","anchor":"ECS-Integration"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptTesting":{"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Write tests next to your gameplay code, run them with ","type":"text"},{"code":"swift test","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" or a command, and keep them out of shipped builds.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptTesting","type":"topi